{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"abibas-first-day","version":1,"title":"Abiba’s First Day","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"It was Abiba’s first day at school. She had a new uniform and a new bag. Her tummy felt wobbly. She felt nervous. ‘What if nobody likes me?’ she whispered.","sentences":["It was Abiba’s first day at school.","She had a new uniform and a new bag.","Her tummy felt wobbly.","She felt nervous.","‘What if nobody likes me?’ she whispered."],"alt":"A girl in a new uniform holds her mother’s hand at a school gate.","image":{"hash":"sha256:908bb50223b55d6455a160683711876f67e4d4f7a3335d58d3979093c9e1a0b8","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:937a4ae772980e071bf5c4671360e03089b4ee79bd61e659444868eee69cbffa","durationMs":19360,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4087],[4087,8391],[8391,11510],[11510,14199],[14199,19360]],"words":[[0,215],[215,538],[538,1183],[1183,1721],[1721,2044],[2044,2259],[2259,4087],[4087,4410],[4410,4733],[4733,4948],[4948,5271],[5271,6024],[6024,6347],[6347,6562],[6562,6885],[6885,8391],[8391,8714],[8714,9252],[9252,9682],[9682,11510],[11510,11833],[11833,12263],[12263,14199],[14199,14629],[14629,14844],[14844,15489],[15489,16027],[16027,17425],[17425,17748],[17748,19360]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Mama knelt down. ‘Everyone feels a little scared on the first day,’ she said. ‘I will be back at home time.’ She gave Abiba a big hug.","sentences":["Mama knelt down.","‘Everyone feels a little scared on the first day,’ she said.","‘I will be back at home time.’ She gave Abiba a big hug."],"alt":"A mother kneels and hugs her daughter at the gate.","image":{"hash":"sha256:4b5a9ac83b7e92f98a8e053bbf4d7eef1b2132091eabaa46bdf96280b8ff8901","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:87e630fa16748fc8d7a8b6581a438df993f5ec0e8d91f4159cbb5dac039cfb6e","durationMs":13520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2222],[2222,8057],[8057,13520]],"words":[[0,370],[370,833],[833,2222],[2222,2963],[2963,3426],[3426,3611],[3611,4167],[4167,4723],[4723,4908],[4908,5186],[5186,5649],[5649,6390],[6390,6668],[6668,8057],[8057,8242],[8242,8612],[8612,8797],[8797,9167],[9167,9352],[9352,9722],[9722,11111],[11111,11389],[11389,11759],[11759,12222],[12222,12407],[12407,12685],[12685,13520]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Madam Aduku met Abiba at the door. ‘Good morning, Abiba,’ she said. ‘We are glad you are here.’ Abiba sat down at a little desk. She did not say a word.","sentences":["Madam Aduku met Abiba at the door.","‘Good morning, Abiba,’ she said.","‘We are glad you are here.’ Abiba sat down at a little desk.","She did not say a word."],"alt":"A teacher welcomes a shy girl at a classroom door.","image":{"hash":"sha256:d09238c0dbc798bebf29706357fd4520f69b0df50f31569619227a0034428813","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:10dd50c087fae341d4837f146be208f56a21d1f14d3545b3eb1342a967a6bd69","durationMs":18000,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3953],[3953,8531],[8531,15501],[15501,18000]],"words":[[0,520],[520,1040],[1040,1352],[1352,1872],[1872,2080],[2080,2392],[2392,3953],[3953,4369],[4369,5618],[5618,6658],[6658,6970],[6970,8531],[8531,8739],[8739,9051],[9051,9467],[9467,9779],[9779,10091],[10091,11652],[11652,12172],[12172,12484],[12484,12900],[12900,13108],[13108,13316],[13316,13940],[13940,15501],[15501,15813],[15813,16125],[16125,16437],[16437,16749],[16749,16957],[16957,18000]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Everyone else seemed to know somebody. Abiba looked at her hands. She felt very small and alone.","sentences":["Everyone else seemed to know somebody.","Abiba looked at her hands.","She felt very small and alone."],"alt":"A girl sits alone at a desk looking at her hands.","image":{"hash":"sha256:82c87dab0684abfde45bfec6f6e9a8b6db2278ab1c52eaa95fc5d8f5f1c2bba1","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:e22cbef444a7052869d558317c0cf31ed71e82971bda0174acf476a2b4bdac29","durationMs":11920,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4881],[4881,8514],[8514,11920]],"words":[[0,908],[908,1362],[1362,2043],[2043,2270],[2270,2724],[2724,4881],[4881,5449],[5449,6130],[6130,6357],[6357,6698],[6698,8514],[8514,8855],[8855,9309],[9309,9763],[9763,10331],[10331,10672],[10672,11920]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Then a boy sat down beside her. His name was Kwartei. He had a box of crayons. ‘Do you want to draw with me?’ he asked. ‘You can have the red one.’","sentences":["Then a boy sat down beside her.","His name was Kwartei.","He had a box of crayons.","‘Do you want to draw with me?’ he asked.","‘You can have the red one.’"],"alt":"A boy offers a red crayon to a girl at a shared desk.","image":{"hash":"sha256:ee08f0b57947d65fffd865c81bfa15c343a16fb6a39c468e92c755a4a5989753","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:781fa9959386e83c6a092e2345e8ab837109dc9acb228b2132df90651dece6f1","durationMs":15280,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3255],[3255,5786],[5786,8498],[8498,13020],[13020,15280]],"words":[[0,362],[362,543],[543,814],[814,1085],[1085,1447],[1447,1989],[1989,3255],[3255,3526],[3526,3888],[3888,4159],[4159,5786],[5786,5967],[5967,6238],[6238,6419],[6419,6690],[6690,6871],[6871,8498],[8498,8679],[8679,8950],[8950,9312],[9312,9493],[9493,9855],[9855,10217],[10217,11392],[11392,11573],[11573,13020],[13020,13291],[13291,13562],[13562,13924],[13924,14195],[14195,14466],[14466,15280]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Abiba took the red crayon. She drew a house. Kwartei drew a sun. They drew and drew. Abiba smiled a little smile.","sentences":["Abiba took the red crayon.","She drew a house.","Kwartei drew a sun.","They drew and drew.","Abiba smiled a little smile."],"alt":"Two children draw a house and a sun together.","image":{"hash":"sha256:fadb281b602d339a6844e436148691cf02c0eadd03870c05819af59eb03f8ca6","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:3a333c5bfc725786f023b9f73de90da16515544012d9d0bc97d319b76ac7702c","durationMs":16800,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3840],[3840,6840],[6840,10080],[10080,13200],[13200,16800]],"words":[[0,600],[600,1080],[1080,1440],[1440,1800],[1800,3840],[3840,4200],[4200,4680],[4680,4920],[4920,6840],[6840,7680],[7680,8160],[8160,8400],[8400,10080],[10080,10560],[10560,11040],[11040,11400],[11400,13200],[13200,13800],[13800,14520],[14520,14760],[14760,15480],[15480,16800]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"After break, Madam Aduku taught them a song. Abiba sang it too, quietly at first, then louder. She knew all the words by the end.","sentences":["After break, Madam Aduku taught them a song.","Abiba sang it too, quietly at first, then louder.","She knew all the words by the end."],"alt":"A class sings together while a girl sings loudly and smiles.","image":{"hash":"sha256:b883def0c8f097b48d9536e343d16147b12f36127ac5bdb2514ae986796e3da7","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:e273222627d15e573af143625ab7b0162c20df9587b353de30305f0a6546c974","durationMs":15280,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5556],[5556,11861],[11861,15280]],"words":[[0,534],[534,1603],[1603,2137],[2137,2671],[2671,3312],[3312,3739],[3739,3953],[3953,5556],[5556,6090],[6090,6517],[6517,6731],[6731,7586],[7586,8334],[8334,8548],[8548,9617],[9617,10044],[10044,11861],[11861,12182],[12182,12609],[12609,12930],[12930,13251],[13251,13785],[13785,13999],[13999,14320],[14320,15280]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"At home time, Mama was waiting at the gate. ‘Mama!’ said Abiba. ‘I made a friend! His name is Kwartei. And I know a new song!’ The end.","sentences":["At home time, Mama was waiting at the gate.","‘Mama!’ said Abiba.","‘I made a friend!","His name is Kwartei.","And I know a new song!’ The end."],"alt":"A girl runs to her mother at the school gate with a drawing in her hand.","image":{"